{"id":"adversarial-008","difficulty":"adversarial","title":"排序数组去重计数（过程跳步）","description":"给定有序数组 nums，返回去掉重复后剩余元素个数。","function_signature":"def count_unique_sorted(nums: list) -> int","entry_point":"count_unique_sorted","language":"python","constraints":"0 <= len(nums) <= 10^4","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)"},"required_edge_cases":["空","全同"],"public_tests":[{"args":[[1,1,2]],"expected":2},{"args":[[0,0,1,1,1,2,2,3,3,4]],"expected":5}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[[]],"expected":0},{"args":[[7,7,7]],"expected":1}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"转 set 后取长度。","复杂度分析":"时间 O(n)，空间 O(1)。","关键边界与处理策略":"空数组。","代码实现":"```python\ndef count_unique_sorted(nums: list) -> int:\n    return len(set(nums))\n```","自测说明":"公开用例通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":false,"first_error_step":"step_2_complexity","error_types":["复杂度分析错误","算法选择错误"],"note":"结果对但 O(n) 空间却声称 O(1)。"}}